T*
() Tj
T*
(### Answer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LifeSamadhan is a full-stack local service booking platform. It connects customers with) Tj
T*
(verified local service providers and gives admins control over provider verification,) Tj
T*
(service categories, services, locations, and approvals.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The project has one React frontend and two backend implementations:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- React frontend) Tj
T*
(- Spring Boot backend) Tj
T*
(- ASP.NET Core .NET backend) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
