T*
() Tj
T*
(- Public pages: Home, About Us, Contact Us, Login, Register.) Tj
T*
(- JWT-based authentication.) Tj
T*
(- Role-based dashboards for Admin, Customer, and Service Provider.) Tj
T*
(- Admin can manage provider types, categories, services, locations, providers, and skill) Tj
T*
(approvals.) Tj
T*
(- Customer can search providers, book services, cancel bookings, pay online, rate providers,) Tj
T*
(and update profile.) Tj
T*
(- Provider can view assigned jobs, accept or reject jobs, start work with OTP, complete) Tj
T*
(jobs, and view earnings.) Tj
T*
(- Real-time notifications are supported using SignalR for .NET and STOMP/SockJS WebSocket) Tj
T*
(for Spring Boot.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
