(## 2. What Problem Is LifeSamadhan Solving?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Question) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Tell me from an interviewer point of view: what problem is it solving?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Answer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LifeSamadhan solves the problem of finding trusted local service providers quickly and) Tj
T*
(safely.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(In daily life, customers need services like repair, maintenance, cleaning, plumbing,) Tj
T*
(electrical work, and other local services. Usually, they face problems such as:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Not knowing which provider is available nearby.) Tj
T*
(- Difficulty checking whether a provider is genuine.) Tj
T*
(- No proper booking and tracking system.) Tj
T*
(- No transparent pricing.) Tj
T*
(- No secure verification before service starts.) Tj
T*
(- No easy rating and feedback system.) Tj
T*
(- Providers also struggle to get genuine service requests in an organized way.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LifeSamadhan provides a digital platform where customers can search verified providers, book) Tj
T*
(services, track status, pay online, and rate service quality. Providers can manage jobs and) Tj
T*
(earnings, while admins can verify providers and control the service ecosystem.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Short Interview Answer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
