(LifeSamadhan is a service provider management and booking platform. It solves the problem of) Tj
T*
(unreliable and unorganized local service booking by connecting customers with verified local) Tj
T*
(providers based on category and location. Customers can book services, track work, pay) Tj
T*
(online, and give feedback, while providers and admins manage the service workflow) Tj
T*
(efficiently.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 3. How Is LifeSamadhan Different From Urban Company?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Question) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(There are already many platforms like Urban Company. How is this different?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Answer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LifeSamadhan is not trying to replace Urban Company directly. Urban Company is a large) Tj
T*
(public marketplace, while LifeSamadhan is designed as a customizable local service) Tj
T*
(management platform.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Key differences:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- LifeSamadhan can be deployed for a specific city, district, society, campus, local) Tj
T*
(business, or institution.) Tj
T*
(- It gives local admins direct control over providers, services, locations, and approvals.) Tj
T*
(- Provider skills can be approved or rejected by admin.) Tj
T*
(- Providers must be verified before they are trusted in the system.) Tj
T*
(- OTP is required before the provider starts service.) Tj
T*
(- Hourly-rate-based pricing is supported.) Tj
T*
(- The same application has both Spring Boot and .NET backend implementations, showing) Tj
T*
(technology flexibility.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Short Interview Answer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Urban Company is a large public marketplace. LifeSamadhan is a customizable local service) Tj
T*
(management platform where an admin can control providers, services, locations, verification,) Tj
T*
(bookings, payments, and ratings for a specific local ecosystem.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
