(### Payment Flow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
(Customer clicks Pay) Tj
T*
(    |) Tj
T*
(Frontend calls POST /api/payment/create-order/{assignmentId}) Tj
T*
(    |) Tj
T*
(Backend creates Razorpay order) Tj
T*
(    |) Tj
T*
(Backend saves payment as PENDING) Tj
T*
(    |) Tj
T*
(Frontend opens Razorpay checkout popup) Tj
T*
(    |) Tj
T*
(Customer completes payment) Tj
T*
(    |) Tj
T*
(Razorpay returns order id, payment id, signature) Tj
T*
(    |) Tj
T*
(Frontend calls POST /api/payment/verify) Tj
T*
(    |) Tj
T*
(Backend marks payment completed and request paid) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Backend Order Creation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`PaymentService` creates Razorpay client:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```java) Tj
T*
(RazorpayClient razorpay = new RazorpayClient\(razorpayKeyId, razorpayKeySecret\);) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(It creates an order:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```java) Tj
T*
(orderRequest.put\("amount", amount.multiply\(new BigDecimal\(100\)\).intValue\(\)\);) Tj
T*
(orderRequest.put\("currency", "INR"\);) Tj
T*
(Order order = razorpay.orders.create\(orderRequest\);) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Razorpay expects amount in paise, so INR amount is multiplied by 100.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Frontend Checkout) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Frontend receives:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
(orderId) Tj
T*
(amount) Tj
T*
(keyId) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
