T*
() Tj
T*
(### Short Interview Answer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Razorpay is integrated for online service payment. The backend creates a Razorpay order and) Tj
T*
(stores a pending payment record. The frontend opens Razorpay checkout. After payment,) Tj
T*
(Razorpay returns payment details, which frontend sends to the backend. The backend updates) Tj
T*
(the payment status and marks the service request as paid.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
