(## 7. Explain OTP In The Project) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Question) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Explain OTP in your project. How is it generated and how does it verify whether it is) Tj
T*
(correct or not?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Answer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(OTP is used to verify that the service provider has actually reached the customer before) Tj
T*
(starting the service.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Where OTP Is Stored) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(OTP is stored in `ServiceAssignment`:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```java) Tj
T*
(@Column\(name = "otp"\)) Tj
T*
(private String otp;) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### OTP Generation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(When a customer books a service, backend creates a service assignment and generates OTP:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```java) Tj
T*
(.otp\(String.format\("%04d", new java.util.Random\(\).nextInt\(10000\)\)\)) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This creates a 4-digit OTP:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
(7    -> 0007) Tj
T*
(45   -> 0045) Tj
T*
(583  -> 0583) Tj
T*
(9821 -> 9821) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
