(### OTP Delivery) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The backend sends OTP to customer email using SMTP:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```java) Tj
T*
(emailService.sendOtpEmail\() Tj
T*
(    customerUser.getEmail\(\),) Tj
T*
(    savedAssignment.getOtp\(\),) Tj
T*
(    providerUser.getName\(\),) Tj
T*
