T*
(### OTP Verification) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Provider enters OTP in provider dashboard. Frontend calls:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
(POST /api/provider/assignment/{assignmentId}/start) Tj
T*
