(if \(assignment.getOtp\(\) == null || !assignment.getOtp\(\).equals\(otp\)\) {) Tj
T*
(    throw new RuntimeException\("Invalid OTP"\);) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
