(## 8. Explain SMTP Used In The Project) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Question) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Explain SMTP used in the project.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Answer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SMTP stands for Simple Mail Transfer Protocol. It is used to send emails from the) Tj
T*
(application to users.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(In LifeSamadhan, SMTP is used to send service OTP emails to customers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
