T*
() Tj
T*
(In `application.properties`:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```properties) Tj
T*
(spring.mail.host=smtp.gmail.com) Tj
T*
(spring.mail.port=587) Tj
T*
(spring.mail.username=<sender-email>) Tj
T*
(spring.mail.password=<app-password>) Tj
T*
(spring.mail.properties.mail.smtp.auth=true) Tj
T*
(spring.mail.properties.mail.smtp.starttls.enable=true) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Meaning:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `smtp.gmail.com`: Gmail SMTP server.) Tj
T*
(- `587`: SMTP TLS port.) Tj
T*
(- `username`: sender email.) Tj
T*
(- `password`: Gmail app password.) Tj
T*
(- `smtp.auth=true`: authentication is required.) Tj
T*
(- `starttls.enable=true`: secure mail transfer is enabled.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Code Usage) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`EmailService` uses Spring Boot `JavaMailSender`:) Tj
T*
() Tj
