(private final JavaMailSender mailSender;) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(It builds and sends the email:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```java) Tj
T*
(SimpleMailMessage message = new SimpleMailMessage\(\);) Tj
T*
(message.setFrom\(fromEmail\);) Tj
T*
(message.setTo\(toEmail\);) Tj
T*
(message.setSubject\("Your Service OTP - LifeSamadhan"\);) Tj
T*
(message.setText\("OTP: " + otp\);) Tj
T*
(mailSender.send\(message\);) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Flow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
