(- API logic.) Tj
T*
(- Database speed.) Tj
T*
(- Number of DB connections.) Tj
T*
(- External calls such as SMTP and Razorpay.) Tj
T*
(- Tomcat thread pool.) Tj
T*
(- Query optimization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(By default, Spring Boot uses embedded Tomcat with a request thread pool. A common default) Tj
T*
(maximum is around 200 worker threads, but this does not mean the app can complete unlimited) Tj
T*
(requests quickly. If database pool has only 10 connections, DB-heavy APIs may wait.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Short Interview Answer) Tj
