(## Quick Final Summary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LifeSamadhan is a role-based local service booking system. The frontend is built with React.) Tj
T*
(The backend is implemented in Spring Boot and also in .NET. JWT secures APIs, Razorpay) Tj
T*
(handles payments, OTP verifies service start, SMTP sends OTP emails, and WebSocket/SignalR) Tj
T*
(handles real-time notifications. For scalability, the project can use thread tuning, DB) Tj
T*
(pooling, indexes, caching, async processing, queues, and horizontal scaling behind a load) Tj
T*
(balancer.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
